  description: "Select the fastest available backend for the current device \u2014 benchmarks each backend, picks the winner, caches the decision",
  longDescription: "The core routing engine. Probes hardware capabilities without privilege elevation, benchmarks available backends, selects the fastest for the workload, and caches the decision. Re-evaluates on major system changes.",
